Recommends: xdg-utils
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: multiple GNOME terminals in one window
 Terminator provides an efficient way to arrange multiple terminals in one
 window. Terminals can be split horizontally or vertically and controlled
 individually or in groups.
 .
 This personal build adds a shortcut for toggling the opacity of all Terminator
 windows.
